[Music]  what's going on everybody it's warren  welcome back to the cosmic wonder where  we talk all things marvel and mcu and we  have some really really big news for all  of you defenders fans out there we're  talking about the punisher daredevil  jessica jones luke cage iron fist and of  course the defender show as well there's  been a lot of speculation about these  shows and these characters recently as  far as how they exactly fit into the mcu  because during the hawkeye series  spoiler alert if you haven't seen it and  managed to avoid the spoiler kingpin  appeared and it was vincent d'onofrio  the same exact kingpin that we saw in  the netflix daredevil series now  dinofrio even came out and said that yes  it is the same exact kingpin that  appeared in the daredevil series  although some still question on whether  or not that's true but he is going to be  appearing in the echo disney plus series  that is going to be coming up later on  so hopefully that'll provide more  clarity however big news today  concerning everybody else fans will be  happy to know that all of these other  netflix marvel shows will be coming to  disney plus and or hulu next month it  was announced not too long ago that all  of these shows were going to be taken  off of netflix and fans were pretty  disappointed but also very excited  because it seemed like marvel studios  was actually going to do something with  these shows and now we know what they're  doing they're putting them on disney  plus in an announcement from marvel it  talks about the new shows coming this  month and of course we have a moon night  that is going to be premiering on march  30th and then it says new this month  march 16th and then it lists all of  these shows daredevil the punisher  jessica jones luke cage iron fist and  the defenders now there has been a  little bit of a debate on whether or not  these are going to actually show up on  disney plus or on hulu some of these are  kind of mature and a little bit more  hard hitting than the other disney plus  marvel shows and typically marvel and  disney will put their more mature  content on disney plus however according  to this statement piece it does seem  like they will be on disney plus we'll  have to wait and see on that but the  good news is is that all of the rights  to these shows has now fallen back to  marvel studios and disney their deal  with netflix is over this means much  like we saw in the hawkeye series marvel  studios in disney are free to use these  characters in the actual mcu and i know  a lot of other fans are really wanting  some of these characters like the  punisher to show up in the mcu so this  is a really good sign that they're  coming to disney plus now of course the  big question here is are they canon to  the mcu did they take place in the mcu  the entire time originally i would have  told you no absolutely not although it's  quite a mystery right now we saw matt  murdock in spiderman no way home and it  looks like he has actually been  daredevil for quite some time we saw how  easily he caught the brick before it hit  peter parker he smiles and makes the  joke i'm a really good lawyer which  really means i'm a really good superhero  too so it looks like he's been daredevil  for quite some time now and obviously  kingpin has been the kingpin for quite  some time in the mcu as well so these  characters and more characters that we  could see like the punisher and luke  cage have technically all been their  character for some time now in their own  series but does that transfer over to  the mcu and if so what exactly does this  mean was any part of the mcu or any  other characters affected by their  stories during their netflix shows these  are questions that we're going to have  to wait to find out unfortunately but  this is exciting news knowing the  possibility that these other heroes  could be appearing in the mcu at some  point in time kingpin and daredevil  opened up the door and now these other  shows are coming to disney plus these  are all really really good signs now of  course it could just be a pick and  choose situation where kevin feige felt  that kingpin was necessary for the  hawkeye series so they threw him in  there the same thing with daredevil it  was necessary for spider-man knowing  home there may not be any solid plans to  put these characters in other movies or  shows but if the moment fits it's good  to know that they are not against  putting them in the mcu so super super  exciting news today all of these shows  are going to be coming to disney plus  and or hulu march 16th and hopefully  we'll be seeing some of these other  characters in some disney plus shows or  in movies sometime soon in the mcu let  me know your thoughts about this in the  comments down below don't forget to like  the video and subscribe so you don't  miss out on any of the latest news for  live updates you can follow me on  instagram and twitter and as always  thank you all so much for watching woof

